Subject: Cantor Bounded Workspace Verification P0 Reentry

@ [reentry_uuid] cc79a959-12d3-478a-9f64-b5dda895cb22
@ [canonical] C:\Project\Cantor\specifications\Cantor_Bounded_Workspace_Verification_P0.sop
@ [proof] C:\Project\Cantor\proofs\Cantor_Bounded_Workspace_Verification_P0_Proof.sop

& [Use]
  + inspect the default JSON plan before expensive verification
  + run test or clippy with Execute only after free-space admission
  + reuse one stable target rather than minting an isolated target per checkpoint

& [Commands]
  + [plan] .\scripts\invoke_bounded_workspace_verification.ps1
  + [test] .\scripts\invoke_bounded_workspace_verification.ps1 -Action test -Execute
  + [clippy] .\scripts\invoke_bounded_workspace_verification.ps1 -Action clippy -Execute
  + [offline_contract] .\scripts\test_bounded_workspace_verification.ps1

& [DoNotInfer]
  + the wrapper does not reclaim capacity automatically
  + success says the selected verification lane passed and does not authorize product behavior
  + no EVO-X2 OneDrive network or background execution is involved

